on is narrow. The shell-retry failure is a known boundary failure with a matched signature, owned by the Step 2 `notice` fix. The JVM ticker-idle fixture is green at this revision, so it is not a current JVM red. Node and Dart legs, the Node composition failure, and the eight-distinct acknowledgement fixture were not run under G0 and are reported unverified, not green. The section 9 boundary-neutral reds remain separately gated and do not block Step 1.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
