cted**, preserving the axiom that semantics are external.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\ndocs/design/daostream-udp-design.md:32: :host \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"192.168.1.100\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"  ;; target address for writes\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/module.cljc:45:   linked module (yin.vm.linker.md section 8.3) -- and its `:slice`\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/module.cljc:76:(defn link-module\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/module.cljc:77:  \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"The `linked` transition's registry update (yin.vm.linker.md sections\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/module.cljc:143:;; A host module is the trusted composition boundary (yin.vm.linker.md\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/module.cljc:203:   The module is entered as an already-linked manifest with\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/module.cljc:311:;; `require` lowers to the linker (yin.vm.linker.md section 7)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/module.cljc:315:  \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"What a kernel supplies the install child and the `linked` transition\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/module.cljc:316:   (yin.vm.linker.md section 7.3). Every method is a pure function of a\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/module.cljc:319:  (link-format\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/module.cljc:321:    \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"`{:format kw :contract s}`: the format this kernel links, and the\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/module.cljc:328:     values (primitives, stream constructor, link pair). `opts` carries\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/module.cljc:360:(def link-request-resource\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/module.cljc:361:  \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"The private resource id of the link request stream (section 6.1): the\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/module.cljc:363:  :yin.link/request)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/module.cljc:366:(def link-response-resource\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/module.cljc:367:  \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"The private resource id of the link response s